# WITHOUT THIS FILE THE BUILD CONTEXT IS ~700 MB OF HARVESTED PAYLOADS.
# Measured on this host 2026-09-14: raw_store 257 MB, _sweep_store 383 MB.
# Both are read from a mounted volume at runtime and neither belongs in a
# layer - an image that carries them is an image that is stale the moment the
# next sweep runs.

# ── the object stores ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
raw_store/
_sweep_store/
_harvest_store/
_substitution_slice/
_unfiltered_sweep/
_unfiltered_sweep_v2/
_control_sweep/
_blog_so_sweep/
_handoff/
handoff.zip

# EXPORT DIRECTORIES, AND THEY ARE THREAD TEXT RATHER THAN SOURCE.
# `scripts/export_contexts_for_extract.py` writes one JSON per thread with
# `flattened_text` and `raw_text_of` INLINED - the export is a copy of the
# corpus, not a pointer into it. Measured on this host 2026-09-18:
# `_export_extract` is 17.8 MB over 1,655 threads, `_export_modelonly` 3.2 MB.
#
# They are gitignored (.gitignore:106), so a build from a git checkout never
# sees them. A build from a working tree does, and that is the whole reason
# these two lines exist: `.gitignore` and `.dockerignore` are different files
# answering different questions, and every other store above is listed in both.
_export_extract/
_export_modelonly/

data/raw/
*.warc
*.warc.gz

# ── run state and backups ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `var/fetch/` is per-container by design; `var/` also holds the repair backups
# written before a staging write, which must never travel in an image.
var/

# ── secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `serve.py` loads `.env` if present for local container runs; on Railway the
# variables come from the platform. Baking one into the image would put a
# database password in a layer anyone who pulls it can read.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ── the frontend, which is the other service ─────────────────────────────────
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/dist-single/

# ── python and tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# ── vcs and local noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
*.log
